 "intro_zh": "乐山大佛景区位于乐山市郊，岷江、青衣江、大渡河三江汇流处，与乐山城隔江相望。景区由凌云山、麻浩岩墓、乌尤山、巨形卧佛等组成，游览面积约8平方公里。景区集聚了乐山山水人文景观的精华，属峨眉山国家级风景区范围，是闻名遐迩的风景旅游胜地。",
 "intro_en": "Leshan Giant Buddha Scenic Area is located on the outskirts of Leshan City, at the confluence of the Minjiang River, Qingyi River and Dadu River, facing Leshan City across the river. The scenic spot consists of Lingyun Mountain, Mahoyan Tomb, Wuyou Mountain, Giant Reclining Buddha, etc. The tourist area is about 8 square kilometers. The scenic spot gathers the essence of Leshan's landscape and cultural landscape. It belongs to the Emeishan National Scenic Area and is a well-known scenic tourist attraction.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
